From ebe5504da451f47cb8c5665f78d5ca9ccbba7c77 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:46:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Borg: credit stat and other modifier bonuses in the item
 value guess

borg_object_value_known() guesses what a known item would fetch in a
shop; the Borg uses the figure to decide what to sell first, what to
junk and what is worth carrying.  For wearables it adds credit for
stat bonuses, stealth, speed, blows, shots, light and the other
modifiers, but two things kept that credit from ever being given:

- the whole block was skipped when the item's pval was zero.  In 4.2
  bonuses are object modifiers and pval is set only for a few kinds
  (launcher multipliers, a flask of oil, a mushroom), so rings,
  amulets, armour and weapons never reached the credits;
- the stat credits tested of_has(item->flags, STAT_STR) and so on,
  using stat numbers as object flag numbers (STAT_INT to STAT_CON are
  the flags SUST_STR to SUST_DEX), and credited pval rather than the
  bonus.

Remove the pval gate and credit the five stat modifiers directly.  A
negative stat modifier earns no credit; the existing check that
returns zero for a negative pval is kept.

The guessed value of most wearables with modifiers rises: for example
a Ring of Strength <+2> goes from 500 to 900, so the Borg now sells a
Ring of Soulkeeping (600) before it, and the Cloak 'Colannon' goes
from 21500 to 81700 (speed +2), so the Borg sells an Amulet of ESP
(25000) before it.

Tracked as diegoami/neo-angband-tracker#70.

(cherry picked from commit 46c6188eccb54bd0571e0a527145f7fd7ed756c3)
---
 src/borg/borg-item-analyze.c | 24 ++++++++++--------------
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-item-analyze.c b/src/borg/borg-item-analyze.c
index 4c50cc91d..e175f7303 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-item-analyze.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-item-analyze.c
@@ -113,21 +113,17 @@ static int32_t borg_object_value_known(borg_item *item)
         if (item->pval < 0)
             return (0L);
 
-        /* No pval */
-        if (!item->pval)
-            break;
-
         /* Give credit for stat bonuses */
-        if (of_has(item->flags, STAT_STR))
-            value += (item->pval * 200L);
-        if (of_has(item->flags, STAT_INT))
-            value += (item->pval * 200L);
-        if (of_has(item->flags, STAT_WIS))
-            value += (item->pval * 200L);
-        if (of_has(item->flags, STAT_DEX))
-            value += (item->pval * 200L);
-        if (of_has(item->flags, STAT_CON))
-            value += (item->pval * 200L);
+        if (item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_STR] > 0)
+            value += (item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_STR] * 200L);
+        if (item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_INT] > 0)
+            value += (item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_INT] * 200L);
+        if (item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_WIS] > 0)
+            value += (item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_WIS] * 200L);
+        if (item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_DEX] > 0)
+            value += (item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_DEX] * 200L);
+        if (item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_CON] > 0)
+            value += (item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_CON] * 200L);
 
         /* Give credit for stealth and searching */
         value += (item->modifiers[OBJ_MOD_STEALTH] * 100L);
